  "title": "Perfect No-Bake Granola Bars",
  "description": "A perfect snack to keep in your fridge and grab when needed, these no-bake granola bars a tasty combination of oats, puffed rice, seeds, protein powder, and nut butters.",
  "authors": [
    "Sharon Angel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2016-02-07T19:01:29-05:00",
